{"asset_key":"timeline/dialoguetree_story_10128114","episode":"timeline","category":"dialoguetree_story","story_id":"10128114","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:5:1028106001:0":{"text":"After activating the memory fragment, will we see Hewynn's memories? Chippy doesn't think she'll like that...","source_cn":"伊温小姐的记忆碎片……激活后，我们也能看到你的回忆吗？...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8ECB02D41B6F2C28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1028106002:0":{"text":"No, it's alright... I'll try to absorb the magic. Please maintain the stability of the fragment. ","source_cn":"不，没关系的……我现在就试着吸收这片魔力，拜托你们维持...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3462156BA88A7808","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028106003:0":{"text":"But...","source_cn":"可是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0028CC28D9216E1C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1028106003":{"text":"But...","source_cn":"可是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0028CC28D9216E1C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:11:1028106004:0":{"text":"A flowing ripple of light emerges. The fragment of the past unfolds before our eyes...","source_cn":"水波般的光芒划过，一段过去的回忆展现在眼前……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4ABE31F0EF507699","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1028106005:0":{"text":"Can nothing be done? I'll beg the sage again or I'll find a healer outside of our lands! I don't believe...","source_cn":"真的没办法了吗？我、我去求薄暮丛林的贤者……去丛林之外...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33A51E2A5024DF6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1028106006:0":{"text":"...this illness... so many have tried to heal me... even Master Arden couldn't...","source_cn":"……我的病……那么多医生都没办法，连雅顿大人都这么说……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33B10731284F32F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1028106007:0":{"text":"I'm sorry, dear... we've been married for six months, and... I may need to break my promise...","source_cn":"对不起，亲爱的……我们结婚才半年，但……我可能做不到对...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD12760B6AD758F81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1028106008:0":{"text":"I-I'm born of the waters of the Taran River yet I can't help those who've lived here for generations...","source_cn":"我、我是从塔兰河中诞生的精灵，却没法帮助世代生活在这条...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8D511486342CECB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1028106009:0":{"text":"Water has the power to soothe all ailments, but I'm unable to wield it...","source_cn":"水明明有着抚慰一切的力量，可我却无法使用这种力量……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8118449BFD3E6C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1028106010:0":{"text":"Why? Because of my cowardice? I'm afraid of new encounters, of strangers... afraid of showing my emotions. Even now, I can't reveal myself to anyone who needs help. ","source_cn":"为什么呢？因为我的胆怯吗？我害怕陌生的环境和人，害怕坦...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFE5F79A021794D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1028106011:1":{"text":"I... what else can I do? ","source_cn":"我……我还能做什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C8BBABFF471B6CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1028106012:0":{"text":"Huh? What happened? Hewynn's memory was cut short! ","source_cn":"诶？发生了什么？伊温小姐的回忆突然中断了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC41368E9B47B3055","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1028106013:2":{"text":"ROAR!!!","source_cn":"吼——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA90EBE31525F914","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:30:1028106013":{"text":"ROAR!!!","source_cn":"吼——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA90EBE31525F914","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1028106014:0":{"text":"Hypofiends! They must be drawn to Hewynn's magic! ","source_cn":"这些——这些魔物！它们肯定是被伊温小姐逸散的魔力吸引来的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39B8F01B67D03339","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1028106015:2":{"text":"Bad monsters! I'll never let them hurt Hewynn or her memories! ","source_cn":"坏家伙！我绝不会让它们伤害到伊温小姐的宝贵回忆！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x883A3A4624CF8106","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1028107001:0":{"text":"Hewynn, we'll take care of the Hypofiends. Don't be scared. ","source_cn":"伊温小姐，我们会解决魔物，不要惊慌。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5568FD73B7372726","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Hewynn, we'll take care of the Hypofiends. Don't be scared. ","female":"Hewynn, we'll take care of the Hypofiends. Don't be scared. ","variant_male_record_index":"110709","variant_female_record_index":"110710","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1028107002:0":{"text":"Thank you, I'm counting on you...","source_cn":"谢谢，拜托你们了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F4B812BEC538A00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:41:10128115:0":{"text":"Hypofiends enticed by Hewynn's scattered magic are drawn to her, hungry to consume her power. The situation turns perilous.","source_cn":"有魔物被伊温流散的魔力吸引了过来，想要吞噬她的力量，情...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8ACB7BBF8AA6547E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:30:0:1":{"text":"It's heading this way!","source_cn":"有怪物过来了！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2D917FB135D7D423","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"It's heading this way!","female":"It's heading this way!","variant_male_record_index":"61180","variant_female_record_index":"61181","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"text":"Shh, don't disturb the memory. ","source_cn":"嘘，不要扰乱这段记忆","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3711759317D1F13D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Shh, don't disturb the memory. ","female":"Shh, don't disturb the memory. ","variant_male_record_index":"61178","variant_female_record_index":"61179","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:42:10128114:0":{"text":"By putting the flower crown in the place where magic disperses, you activate one of Hewynn's memory fragments.","source_cn":"你将花冠放到魔力散逸的地方，激活了伊温的记忆碎片。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9EFDD2AE48F98794","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_ind